        "Description": "Agent 47,\r\rToday&apos;s assignment is simple: spread a little SMG (so-much-goodness.) Five fortunate individuals have been selected to recieve your generosity. Deliver each blessing swiftly, quietly, and in your finest suit. The ICA apprieciates your charitable spirit.\r\r- International Contract Agency\r\r*CONFIDENTIAL*",
